# Tooling

- Use Swift Package Manager for dependencies and unit tests.
- Run `swift test` before finishing.
- Treat `swift run` as the macOS host check, not iOS distribution validation.
- Use Xcode for simulator/device runs, signing, capabilities, assets, previews,
  and archives.
- Keep generated Xcode user data and `.build` out of version control.
